# --- user data & caches (must NEVER reach a public repo) -------------------
# ⚠ These are DATA folders that sit beside source folders with similar names.
# app\render_deck\, app\licensing\, app\updater\ and app\madiref\ are SOURCE and
# must stay tracked - do not "tidy" this list by widening a pattern.
library/
_preview_cache/
_madiref_cache/
_madiref_notes/
render_queue/
render_presets/
baked/
config.json
license.bin
dev_edits.json
dev_edits.baked_*.json
bridge.token
addon_update_result.json
blender_hang_report.txt

# --- internal engineering notes (not part of the public project) -----------
# The public documentation is manual\, built into a site by mkdocs.yml. The
# files below are a working journal - decisions, dead ends, dated entries - and
# they stay local by choice.
docs/
HANDOFF.md
RESUME_PROMPT.md
*_PLAN.md
tests/branding_words.py

# --- local-only deployment detail ------------------------------------------
# ⚠ The licence server URL. `app\licensing\manager.py` falls back to the
# MADI_LICENSE_SERVER environment variable without it, so a clone still runs -
# but a BUILD made without it cannot sign in, and verify_exe.py fails the build
# rather than letting that ship.
app/licensing/endpoint.py

